  "Scan result": "Resultado del escaneo",
  "The code matches the keys this phone holds for {who}. Nobody is in between.": "El código coincide con las claves que este teléfono tiene de {who}. No hay nadie en medio.",
  "{who} is answering with different keys right now. Settle that on their card before marking anything.": "{who} está respondiendo con claves distintas ahora mismo. Resuelve eso en su tarjeta antes de marcar nada.",
